<h2 class="kt-adv-heading84_d63572-21 is-style-text-48px wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-9-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_d63572-21">Discover Moraine Valley and imagine what’s possible in <mark class="kt-highlight">health care.</mark></h2>



<figure class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image84_49473b-af size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="144" height="16" src="https://www.morainevalley.edu/wp-content/uploads/Separator.png" alt="" class="kb-img wp-image-419"/></figure>



<p class="kt-adv-heading84_0c0d27-cc is-style-text-18px wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_0c0d27-cc">At Moraine Valley, you will find small class sizes, faculty with real-world experience, collaborative learning spaces and a thriving community. Explore over 140 programs with flexible online options and stay comfortably within your budget.</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns84_75c9ac-b5"><a class="kb-button kt-button button kb-btn84_3003e9-99 kt-btn-size-standard kt-btn-width-type-auto wp-block-button__link button-style-secondary kb-btn-global-inherit kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-false wp-block-kadence-singlebtn kb-preset--theme-secondary" href="https://www.morainevalley.edu/program-category/health-care/"><span class="kt-btn-inner-text">Learn More About Health Sciences</span></a></div>
</div></div>
</div></div>

</div></div></div></div>

</div></div>

