<p class="kt-adv-heading84_2b6e02-eb is-style-text-18px wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_2b6e02-eb">At Moraine Valley, campus life is booming! Join student clubs, cheer on the Cyclones or stay active at&nbsp;FitRec, our fitness and recreation center. There’s lots of  ways to get involved and make the most of your days on campus.</p>



