</div></div>
</div></div>

</div></div>

<div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id84_373c6b-d2 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column84_203cf1-89"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column84_8a3a0a-85"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h2 class="kt-adv-heading84_70cbc5-fd is-style-text-58px wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_70cbc5-fd">Student Stories <mark class="kt-highlight">That Inspire</mark></h2>



<p class="kt-adv-heading84_38b395-98 is-style-text-24px wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-theme-palette-11-color has-text-color" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_38b395-98">Meet the students who are setting the standard at Moraine Valley.</p>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns84_767cfd-21"><a class="kb-button kt-button button kb-btn84_f97ed2-67 kt-btn-size-standard kt-btn-width-type-auto wp-block-button__link kb-btn-global-inherit kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-false wp-block-kadence-singlebtn kb-preset--theme-base" href="https://www.morainevalley.edu/storywall/"><span class="kt-btn-inner-text">Read Our Students&#8217; Stories</span></a></div>


<div class="kb-advanced-slider kb-advanced-slider-84_18f407-e0 slider__desktop-remove-margin wp-block-kadence-slider"><div class="kb-advanced-slider-inner-contain kb-adv-slider-html-version-2"><div class="kb-blocks-advanced-carousel kt-blocks-carousel kt-carousel-container-dotstyle-custom"><div class="kb-blocks-advanced-slider-init kb-slider-loading kb-blocks-slider kt-carousel-arrowstyle-none kt-carousel-dotstyle-custom kb-slider-size-fixed kb-slider-type-carousel kb-slider-ratio-12-5 kb-slider-group-arrow kb-slider-arrow-position-center kb-slider-tab-ratio-inherit kb-slider-mobile-ratio-inherit splide kb-splide  kb-slider-version-3" aria-label="Slider content" data-slider-center-mode="false" data-slider-type="carousel" data-loop-type="loop" data-columns-xxl="4" data-columns-xl="4" data-columns-md="2" data-columns-sm="2" data-columns-xs="1" data-columns-ss="1" data-slider-anim-speed="400" data-slider-scroll="1" data-slider-fade="true" data-slider-arrows="false" data-slider-dots="true" data-slider-hover-pause="false" data-slider-auto="false"  data-dragging="true" data-slider-speed="7000" data-slider-gap="0" data-slider-gap-tablet="0" data-slider-gap-mobile="0" data-slider-gap-unit="px"><div class="splide__track"><ul class="splide__list">

<li class="wp-block-kadence-slide kb-advanced-slide-item kb-slide-84_410d5a-ca"><div class="kb-advanced-slide"><div class="kb-advanced-slide-inner-wrap kb-slide-align-left kb-slide-valign-top"><div class="kb-advanced-slide-inner">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column84_4ece75-a4 kb-section-has-overlay"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-accordion alignnone testimonial-accordion"><div class="kt-accordion-wrap kt-accordion-id84_bfb110-46 kt-accordion-has-2-panes kt-active-pane-0 kt-accordion-block kt-pane-header-alignment-left kt-accodion-icon-style-basic kt-accodion-icon-side-right" style="max-width:none"><div class="kt-accordion-inner-wrap" data-allow-multiple-open="false" data-start-open="none">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-1 kt-pane84_8d244c-e1"><h3 class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title">Kylynn Hernandez <br>Pursuing a career in the trades</span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></h3><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="kt-adv-heading84_4554d5-d1 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_4554d5-d1">Pursuing a career in the trades wasn’t at the forefront of Kylynn Hernandez’s mind when she was thinking about her future, but social media posts sparked her curiosity in a new career and prompted her to enroll in classes at Moraine Valley.</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column84_3cf872-15 kb-section-dir-horizontal"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<figure class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image84_b7518c-93 size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="16" height="12" src="https://www.morainevalley.edu/wp-content/uploads/1.png" alt="quote" class="kb-img wp-image-497"/></figure>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-84_c50770-79"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>
</div></div>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow" style="border-style:none;border-width:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;font-size:1rem">
<p class="kt-adv-heading84_da35fd-bd wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_da35fd-bd">“I had some other things in mind, but then videos and pictures about welding kept coming across my [Instagram and TikTok] feed and I was like, ‘Oh, wow, I think I would like to pursue this.’ You know, at least give it a try,”</p>
</blockquote>



<div class="kt-adv-heading84_e5e4c1-61 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_e5e4c1-61">— Mechanical Technologies Department</div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-84_ffb489-df"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>
</div></div></div>
</div></div></div>
</div></div>
</div></div></div></li>



<li class="wp-block-kadence-slide kb-advanced-slide-item kb-slide-84_e1b3f5-38"><div class="kb-advanced-slide"><div class="kb-advanced-slide-inner-wrap kb-slide-align-left kb-slide-valign-top"><div class="kb-advanced-slide-inner">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column84_0d9c29-89 kb-section-has-overlay"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-accordion alignnone testimonial-accordion"><div class="kt-accordion-wrap kt-accordion-id84_c85e05-5d kt-accordion-has-2-panes kt-active-pane-0 kt-accordion-block kt-pane-header-alignment-left kt-accodion-icon-style-basic kt-accodion-icon-side-right" style="max-width:none"><div class="kt-accordion-inner-wrap" data-allow-multiple-open="false" data-start-open="none">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-1 kt-pane84_149eee-73"><h3 class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title">Reggie Strong<br>College basketball</span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></h3><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="kt-adv-heading84_baa71d-ba wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_baa71d-ba">These days, Reggie sails from one end of the court to the other, like he never had to relearn how to walk. His ultimate goal is to play at an NCAA Division I university before going pro. But he also is eager to earn a degree (he earned a 3.1 GPA this fall) and potentially return to the classroom teaching statistics or business. With athletics in his blood, he wants to become a coach as well, dispensing the wisdom he gained far too young. Until then, he’ll keep hustling and defying the odds.</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column84_9c183b-82 kb-section-dir-horizontal"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<figure class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image84_fcee47-84 size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="16" height="12" src="https://www.morainevalley.edu/wp-content/uploads/1.png" alt="quote" class="kb-img wp-image-497"/></figure>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-84_f81e92-e5"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>
</div></div>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow" style="border-style:none;border-width:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;font-size:1rem">
<p class="kt-adv-heading84_764da1-13 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_764da1-13">“This is what I wanted for Reggie – to play college ball,” Dianne beamed. “I want to be here to see all his dreams come true. And I’m pretty confident he’ll do it. We’re so proud of him.”</p>
</blockquote>



<div class="kt-adv-heading84_7e1d47-01 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_7e1d47-01">— Colleague, Communications Department</div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-84_617f8a-51"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>
</div></div></div>
</div></div></div>
</div></div>
</div></div></div></li>



<li class="wp-block-kadence-slide kb-advanced-slide-item kb-slide-84_22e3b2-b2"><div class="kb-advanced-slide"><div class="kb-advanced-slide-inner-wrap kb-slide-align-left kb-slide-valign-top"><div class="kb-advanced-slide-inner">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column84_dea754-64 kb-section-has-overlay"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-accordion alignnone testimonial-accordion"><div class="kt-accordion-wrap kt-accordion-id84_b8d293-46 kt-accordion-has-2-panes kt-active-pane-0 kt-accordion-block kt-pane-header-alignment-left kt-accodion-icon-style-basic kt-accodion-icon-side-right" style="max-width:none"><div class="kt-accordion-inner-wrap" data-allow-multiple-open="false" data-start-open="none">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-1 kt-pane84_8cd096-54"><h3 class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title">Maya Hyser<br>Graduated Student</span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></h3><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="kt-adv-heading84_496a45-f2 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_496a45-f2">Since she was a child, Maya Hyser always told everyone she would be a nurse. True to her long-held vision, Maya will graduate in December 2025 from the Moraine Valley Nursing Program.</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column84_f1c34c-4d kb-section-dir-horizontal"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<figure class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image84_b93a9d-ed size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="16" height="12" src="https://www.morainevalley.edu/wp-content/uploads/1.png" alt="quote" class="kb-img wp-image-497"/></figure>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-84_21aaaa-90"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>
</div></div>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow" style="border-style:none;border-width:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;font-size:1rem">
<p class="kt-adv-heading84_837ee1-89 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_837ee1-89">“My mom graduated and started working immediately, and then went on to earn her bachelor’s degree. She told me all about her experience at Moraine Valley and how much she loved it. I saw that she was thriving, and she is so good and so smart at what she does, and that really inspired me.”</p>
</blockquote>



<div class="kt-adv-heading84_b79ff3-17 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_b79ff3-17">— Health Sciences Department</div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-84_9cb33e-87"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>
</div></div></div>
</div></div></div>
</div></div>
</div></div></div></li>



<li class="wp-block-kadence-slide kb-advanced-slide-item kb-slide-84_5ccb49-74"><div class="kb-advanced-slide"><div class="kb-advanced-slide-inner-wrap kb-slide-align-left kb-slide-valign-top"><div class="kb-advanced-slide-inner">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column84_f8cbcd-97 kb-section-has-overlay"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-accordion alignnone testimonial-accordion"><div class="kt-accordion-wrap kt-accordion-id84_d9c19c-4d kt-accordion-has-2-panes kt-active-pane-0 kt-accordion-block kt-pane-header-alignment-left kt-accodion-icon-style-basic kt-accodion-icon-side-right" style="max-width:none"><div class="kt-accordion-inner-wrap" data-allow-multiple-open="false" data-start-open="none">
<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-1 kt-pane84_95a893-a3"><h3 class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title">Kristian Zajac</span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></h3><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="kt-adv-heading84_90ef7d-b3 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_90ef7d-b3">Between the initial general education courses he needed to complete for civil engineering and the abundance of options to pursue his musical interests, Kristian is happy he started his education at Moraine Valley.</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column84_accaca-a0 kb-section-dir-horizontal"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<figure class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image84_72be8a-c5 size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="16" height="12" src="https://www.morainevalley.edu/wp-content/uploads/1.png" alt="quote" class="kb-img wp-image-497"/></figure>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-84_1a34f1-51"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>
</div></div>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow" style="border-style:none;border-width:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;font-size:1rem">
<p class="kt-adv-heading84_a2feac-c6 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_a2feac-c6">&#8220;I decided to go to Moraine Valley because they have some programs I like and it was close to home. I honestly didn’t know there was a music program. I kind of just stumbled into it and I’m very glad I did&#8221;</p>
</blockquote>



<div class="kt-adv-heading84_0894c3-20 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_0894c3-20">— Current Student</div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-84_b0f9c3-40"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>
</div></div></div>
</div></div></div>
</div></div>
</div></div></div></li>

</ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>

</div></div>

<div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id84_64ea10-f3 alignfull kt-row-has-bg wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-row kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-middle kt-inner-column-height-full kb-theme-content-width">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column84_142dab-c3 kvs-lg-false kvs-md-false kvs-sm-false"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column84_a29c08-6d"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h2 class="kt-adv-heading84_a97fc2-d8 is-style-text-82px wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_a97fc2-d8">We&#8217;re here to <mark class="kt-highlight">help you succeed.</mark></h2>



<p class="kt-adv-heading84_a39b55-98 is-style-text-20px wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading84_a39b55-98">From academic assistance to campus resources and personal guidance, explore the services offered to support you at every step of your journey.</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns84_b9784f-b4"><a class="kb-button kt-button button kb-btn84_e2579d-a0 kt-btn-size-standard kt-btn-width-type-fixed wp-block-button__link button-style-secondary kb-btn-global-inherit kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-false wp-block-kadence-singlebtn kb-preset--theme-secondary" href="https://www.morainevalley.edu/student-resources/advising/"><span class="kt-btn-inner-text">Academic Advising</span></a>

